HYSTORICAL OF DOCUMENT No Revision Date Revision Status Concern Amendment 1 00 / 01.05.2025 - Dokumen Baru New Document Penerbitan Dokumen Baru Publishing new document 2 FLOW DIAGRAM Flow Remark HRGA menjadwalkan periode penilaian vendor outsourcing User Melakukan Evaluasi Performa Outsourcing, berdasarkan data performa outsourcing, performance dashboard, pengalaman User. Proses penilaian Pada proses penilaian mempertimbangkan antara lain Kualitas Pekerja, Kepatuhan Regulasi, Kualitas Layanan, Kinerja LK3 vendor outsourcing Reporting (Hasil Evaluasi). Hasil penilaian dibuatkan dalam bentuk laporan atau rekap data penilaian. Tindak Lanjut. Laporan hasil evaluasi ditindaklakunti dengan memberikan umpan balik kepada Management Outsourcing, khsusunya operasional Management Outsourcing. TUJUAN / PURPOSE Prosedur ini ditetapkan untuk mengukur dan memantau kinerja Perusahaan Penyedia Jasa (Vendor) secara objektif dan berkala, guna memastikan standar layanan terpenuhi serta sebagai landasan pengambilan keputusan perpanjangan kontrak tahunan. This procedure is established to measure and monitor the performance of Service Providers (Vendors) objectively and periodically, to ensure service standards are met and as a basis for annual contract renewal decisions. RUANG LINGKUP / SCOPE Prosedur ini mencakup seluruh tahapan evaluasi semesteran (6 bulan) terhadap entitas Vendor Outsourcing yang bekerja sama dengan perusahaan, meliputi aspek operasional, legalitas, dan K3. This procedure covers all stages of bi-annual evaluation (6 months) for Outsourcing Vendor entities cooperating with the company, covering operational, legality, and HSE aspects. ISTILAH / TERM N/A TANGGUNG JAWAB / RESPONSIBILITY Department Head Section Head HRGA Department Head HRGA Industrial Relation Section Head DEFINISI / DEFINITION REFERENSI / REFERENCE 5.1 ISO 9001:2015 5.2 FSSC 22000 ver 5.1 5.3 AIB 5.4 GMP + B3 5.5 Sistem Jaminan Halal / Halal Assurance System 5.6 SMK3-Peraturan Pemerintah No.50 tahun 2012 URAIAN PROSEDUR / DESCRIBED PROCEDURE No PROSEDUR Procedure Penanggung Jawab Person in Charge Dokumen Record 1. 1.1. HRGA menetapkan jadwal evaluasi kinerja vendor sebanyak 2 (dua) kali dalam satu tahun: Penilaian I : dilakukan pada akhir bulan Juni. Penilaian II : dilakukan pada akhir bulan Desember. HRGA determines the vendor performance evaluation schedule 2 (two) times a year: Assessment I at the end of June, and Assessment II at the end of December. HRGA – Industrial Relation F/MNASRG-PGA-23-038 2. Distribusi Form Evaluasi Vendor kepada seluruh User/Departemen terkait. HRGA distributes the Evaluation Form to all related Users/Departments HRGA-Industrial Relation Outsourcing Dashboard 3. Aspek Penilaian 3.1. Kinerja Tenaga Kerja (Bobot 20%) User menilai rata-rata kualitas hasil kerja, produktivitas, dan kehadiran tenaga kerja yang disediakan vendor. 3.2. Kepatuhan dan Regulasi (Bobot 25%) HRGA memverifikasi kelengkapan kontrak kerja, izin operasional, dan kepatuhan pembayaran hak normatif (Upah/BPJS). 3.3. Kualitas Layanan (Bobot 30%) User dan HRGA menilai responsivitas manajemen vendor, kompetensi pengurus, dan sistem rekrutmen/seleksi. 3.4. Kinerja LK3 (Bobot 25%) User menilai angka kecelakaan kerja, kepatuhan APD, dan partisipasi pelatihan keselamatan. Assesment Aspect 3.1 Manpower Performance (Weight 20%). User assesses the average work quality, productivity, and attendance of the manpower provided by the vendor. 3.2 Compliance & Regulation (Weight 25%). HRGA verifies the completeness of employment contracts, operational permits, and compliance with normative rights payments (Wages/Social Security). 3.3 Service Quality (Weight 30%). User and HRGA assess vendor management responsiveness, administrator competence, and recruitment/selection systems. 3.4 Safety Performance (Weight 25%). User assesses workplace accident rates, PPE compliance, and safety training participation. User / Department / Section Head F/MNASRG-PGA-23-038 4. 4.1. Pengumpulan hasil penilaian dari seluruh departemen. 4.2. Menghitung Rata-rata Skor Total (Resume Penilaian All Dept) untuk mendapatkan Nilai Akhir Vendor. 4.1. HRGA collects assessment results from all departments. 4.2. Calculate the Average Total Score (Resume of All Dept Assessment) to obtain the Vendor's Final Score. HRGA-Industrial Relation 5 5.1. Menentukan Grade Vendor (A/B/C) berdasarkan tabel skala penilaian. Melakukan tindak lanjut sesuai periode penilaian - Juni (Penilaian I): Fokus pada permintaan perbaikan kinerja. - Desember (Penilaian II): Fokus pada keputusan kelanjutan kontrak. Score penilaian menggunakan skala 0 s/d 100 dan Grade A (Memenuhi Harapan-Meets Expectation), B (Perlu Perbaikan-Needs Improvement), C (Tidak Memuaskan-Unsatisfaction Performance) 5.1 Determine Vendor Grade (A/B/C) based on the rating scale table. 5.2 Execute follow-up according to the assessment period (See Point E): June (Assessment I) focuses on performance improvement requests; December (Assessment II) focuses on contract continuation decisions. HRGA-Industrial Relation 6. Kebijakan Tindak Lanjut Hasil Penilaian I (Periode Juni) Tindak lanjut pada semester pertama difokuskan pada pembinaan dan perbaikan operasional Jika Grade A (> 71.0): Kinerja dinyatakan baik, vendor diminta mempertahankan standar layanan. Jika Grade B (51.0 - 70.99): Masuk kategori "Perlu Perbaikan" (Needs Improvement). Vendor WAJIB membuat rencana perbaikan (Corrective Action Plan) dan menjalankannya. Vendor diberikan waktu 6 (enam) bulan berikutnya (Juli - Desember) untuk melakukan perbaikan kinerja secara signifikan. Jika Grade C (< 50.99): Diberikan Surat Peringatan Keras (SP) dan peninjauan ulang kerjasama segera. Hasil Penilaian II (Periode Desember) Hasil pada akhir tahun bersifat menentukan untuk kelangsungan kerjasama tahun berikutnya Review Kelanjutan Kontrak: Nilai Penilaian II (Desember) dijadikan bahan utama dan dasar pertimbangan manajemen untuk memperpanjang atau memutus kontrak kerja sama di tahun selanjutnya. Ketentuan Pemutusan: Apabila setelah diberikan kesempatan perbaikan (dari Penilaian I), Vendor masih mendapatkan nilai di bawah standar pada Penilaian II, maka Perusahaan berhak menunjuk Vendor baru untuk menggantikannya. Follow-up in the first semester focuses on guidance and operational improvement If Grade A: Performance is declared good, vendor is asked to maintain service standards. If Grade B: Categorized as "Needs Improvement". Vendor MUST create a Corrective Action Plan and execute it. Vendor is given the next 6 (six) months to perform significant performance improvements If Grade C: Strict Warning Letter is issued and immediate cooperation review is conducted. Results at the end of the year are decisive for the continuity of cooperation in the following year Contract Renewal Review: Assessment II Score (December) serves as the main material and basis for management consideration to renew or terminate the cooperation contract for the following year Termination Provision: If after being given an opportunity for improvement (from Assessment I), the Vendor still obtains a substandard score in Assessment II, the Company reserves the right to appoint a new Vendor to replace them HRGA-Industrial Relation KETERANGAN / REMARKS
